@step List requests, grants and keys for the human-authorized profile, including an empty inventory.
@static aeat config profile automation list
@blocked credential-store Automation inventory requires an available protected credential store as well as human authorization; restore access to that store before retrying.
@step Inspect the exact returned request before deciding.
@static aeat config profile automation inspect REQUEST_UUID
@blocked operator-artifact REQUEST_UUID must come from a pending request returned by the intended profile's current inventory.
